}

Use actual calculated values in production.

The schema is illustrative, not sample scientific data.

## 9.5 Scientific testing

Create test cases using known mathematical datasets.

Include:

- Clearly increasing synthetic series.
- Clearly decreasing synthetic series.
- Stable random series.
- Seasonal series.
- Autocorrelated series.
- Missing observations.
- Short time series.
- Extreme outliers.

Label synthetic test data clearly.

Validate the implementation against trusted statistical reference cases.

